OL,4,CDR Congo says military aircraft        
OL,5,Cmissing as rebels claim to shoot down  
OL,6,Cplane                                  
OL,7,GThe Democratic Republic of Congo       
OL,8,Gmilitary says it is searching for one  
OL,9,Gof its aircraft, after rebels said     
OL,10,Gthey had shot down a warplane in the   
OL,11,Geast.                                  
OL,13,FThe military said it had lost contact  
OL,14,Fwith a small Cessna 208 cargo plane on 
OL,15,FSunday following "poor weather         
OL,16,Fconditions". The fate of the plane and 
OL,17,Fits crew remained uncertain, it added. 
